window.products.push({"id":126071,"name":"8269145 Undercounter Dishwasher Mounting Brackets Dishwasher Clips Dishwasher Bracket with Mounting Screws Compatible with WP 8269145 Compatible with ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tgr33JgrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features:  How to install: 1. Turn off power to your dishwasher. (Make sure to avoid shock) 2. Rotate lower access panel fasteners to remove them. 3. Remove the access panel or sound dampening pad. Judge whether the water supply or power lines have enough slack to move the dishwasher. If not, you will need to turn off the water supply valve, disconnect the water supply line from the inlet valve and release the power line from the junction box. 4. Open the dishwasher door, unscrew the screws from the existing brackets. 5. Next will be moving the dishwasher. To do so, you need to lower the dishwasher by adjusting the leveling legs. 6. Carefully pull the dishwasher a few inches away from the front of the cabinet. 7. Use pliers to pull up tabs in back of the bracket (if present). Pull out brackets which are former applied. 8. Insert fresh brackets. Use pliers to adjust the back tab to lock the brackets in place. 9. Slide the dishwasher back into the cabinet (readjusting the leveling legs, if necessary). Replace the screws in your fresh brackets. 10. Reverse steps 3, 2 and 1.  Specifications: Size: about 3 inches in length and 1 inch in width (at the widest) Color: as shown in the picture Material: galvanized steel  Package includes: 4 x Undercounter mounting brackets 4 x Mounting screws  Warm notes: Please allow a little error on the size due to manual measurement. The color might exist slight difference due to different displays. Please read the size instruction carefully before purchasing. The mention of brand names and any related models above is only for purposes of demonstrating compatibility. Our brand name is Honoson.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tgr33JgrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Honoson","source_asin":"B09FDPNWDD","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-126071","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FDPNWDD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FDPNWDD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
