window.products.push({"id":126080,"name":"EUHOMY Nugget Ice Maker Countertop with Handle, Ready in 6 Mins, 33lbs/24H, Removable Top Cover, Auto-Cleaning, Portable Pebble Ice Maker with Basket ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZumpniT1L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"6 MINS ICE-MAKING & NUGGET ICE: Quench your thirst fast with efficient EUHOMY nugget ice maker! You can enjoy fresh sonic ice and cold drinks in 6-8 mins. Featuring a 1.2Qt water tank, it easily makes up to 33 lbs of ice daily and has a 1.8 lbs removeable basket. The unique, crunchy soft pellet ice won't hurt your hands or mouth and cools drinks quickly while retaining their taste, providing a joyfully chewable experience. It's so perfect for cocktails, smoothies and other beverages. COMPACT & PORTABLE DESIGN: Our nugget ice maker has a sturdy handle and a compact size (LWH) of 9.45 x 11.61 x 12.99 in. Those features make our pebble ice maker easy to carry and so perfect for any occasions such as Home/Office/Camping/Party/Bar/RV. Another user-friendly design is the ice scoop holder on the back that allows easy storage when not in use, the large viewing window allows direct monitoring of the ice-making process. Buy now and enjoy refreshing drinks all summer long! SMART & AUTO-CLEANING: Unlike other ice makers that run in cycles, aging the internals. EUHOMY nugget ice maker features \"ICE FULL\" indicator to stop ice-making and remind you to take out ice. The \"ADD WATER\" will alert you to add water. Pellet ice maker will run a 15 mins self-cleaning by a simple press the \"ON/OFF\" for 3s after adding water. The top cover is also easily lifted for more thorough cleaning. Our double cleaning design provides a safe and clean ice-making experience. QUIETER & ENERGY-SAVING & ECO-FRIENDLY: Our countertop nugget ice maker excellent at refrigeration while running at less than 50 dB noise, ensuring a comfortable and quiet environment for working or sleeping. With its low energy consumption of about 1 kWh/8H, you'll save more on electricity bills while enjoying refreshing drinks. And by choosing our eco-friendly ice maker, you'll make a positive impact on the environment. Wow your guests before they try delicious sonic ice! ETL CERTIFICATION & WARRANTY PROMISE: Our nugget ice maker is ETL certified to ensure top-quality and safety. You can use pebble ice maker with confidence. Our mission is to provide premium ice makers at reasonable prices. We offer ① 1-year warranty from the original purchase date; ② Lifetime technical support. Suppose you have any questions about using our pellet ice maker, please reach out to us anytime! Our 24/7 customer support is always ready to assist you with anything you need.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZumpniT1L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"E EUHOMY","source_asin":"B0C8GF5TLP","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-126080","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C8GF5TLP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C8GF5TLP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
