window.products.push({"id":126123,"name":"Amana Electric Dryer, NED7500VW, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Sx6qhE6pL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Product Description Amana® 7.2 cu. ft. Super Capacity Electric Dryer Electronic controls let you know just how much time is left before the cycle is done, and the control panel indicates both cycle selected and time remaining. Put a stop to wrinkles with optional extended tumbling to help prevent dry clothes from developing pesky creases. Product Features Additional Features 7.2 cu. ft. Capacity With a 7.2 cu. ft. capacity, there's room for more in every load, which means you'll spend less time on laundry and more time on the things you enjoy. Flexible Configuration Place this dryer next to the washer, or save space in your laundry room with an optional stacking kit. Wrinkle Prevent Option Put a stop to wrinkles. After the load is finished, clothes tumble intermittently without heat to help stop wrinkles from forming. Automatic Dryness Control Sensors monitor dryness level and temperature, automatically stopping the cycle when fabrics are dry so you don't have to worry. Clothes come out dry, but not cooked. Electronic Controls with Cycle Status Window Electronic controls make it easy to choose the ideal cycle and options for each load. The cycle status window shows time remaining and where the load is in the wash process. 9 cycles 9 cycles 6 temperature settings 6 temperature settings Touch Up cycle Touch Up cycle Denim cycle Denim cycle Quick Dry cycle Quick Dry cycle Adjustable dry time Adjustable dry time End-of-cycle signal End-of-cycle signal Drum light Drum light Matching Appliances Amana® 4.0 cu. ft. Capacity Front-Load Washer 15.5\" Laundry Pedestal with Storage Drawer 10\" Laundry Pedestal Parts & Accessories Dryer Vent Installer Kit Keep it flowing with safe and efficient metal venting. A four-foot vent section attaches to a close elbow, while another attaches to a wall offset. Plus, an extension collar takes it to greater lengths. Dryer Vent Cleaning Brush Help lower utility bills, reduce drying time and extend the life of your dryer by thoroughly removing lint on a regular basis. Great for dryers with top-mounted lint screens. Dryer Power Cords Plug and go for top-notch tumbling. These cords safely connect your dryer to an electrical outlet. 4' 30 AMP, 3-Prong #PT220L 4', 30 AMP, 4-Prong #PT400L 6', 30 AMP, 4-Prong #PT600L Before You Buy How much room do you have for a laundry pair? Is it located in a convenient spot for your household? The Amana® front-load laundry pair offers flexible installation options, including placing it under a countertop or, for smaller spaces, with the dryer stacked on top of the washer. Is it difficult for you to see your clothes when you're loading and unloading? A drum light on this Amana® dryer improves visibility so you can always tell if you're grabbing your favorite shirt. Does your current dryer cook your clothes? How often do items come out just a little bit smaller? Don't worry, we've got it under control — Automatic Dryness Control. The dryer monitors temperatures so you don't have to. Clothes get the attention they need and come out dry — but not smaller. Dimensions Things to Consider Tip #1 Measure the space for your new washer (or laundry pair) as well as any doorways or hallways the appliances must fit through. Tip #2 Make sure the floor is level, with no more than a one-inch slope. Tip #3 If installing a laundry pair, ensure that there are hot and cold water lines within three feet of washer hookups. Tip #4 For an electric dryer, you will need a three- or four-prong outlet with a 30-amp circuit. Warranty Information Limited One Year Warranty - Parts and Labor - For one (1) year from the original retail purchase date, any part that fails in normal home use will be repaired or replaced free of charge. Refer to amana.com or the individual product Use and Care Guide for warranty details. From the Manufacturer Electronic controls let you know just how much time is left before the cycle is done, and the control panel indicates both cycle selected and time remaining. Also, put a stop to wrinkles with optional extended tumbling to help prevent dry clothes from developing pesky creases.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Sx6qhE6pL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMANA","source_asin":"B003T6ACU0","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-126123","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003T6ACU0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B003T6ACU0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
