window.products.push({"id":126133,"name":"OKADA Countertop Portable Ice Maker Machine - 9 Ice Cubes Ready in 6 Mins - Makes 26 lbs Ice in 24 hrs - Electric Ice Making Machine with Removable Ba","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":200.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Xw2QCnBnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【QUIET & QUICKLY MAKE ICE IN 6 MINUTES】The ice making machine can produce up to 26 pounds of ice per 24 hrs and you can get 9 bullet-shape ice cubes in as little as 6 minutes. You won't have to deal with ice trays ever again. It stores up to 1.5 pounds of ice at a time in its insulated storage bin. Besides, our ice maker equipped with 21g R600a refrigerant so that you can enjoy fresh ice cubes without bearing too much noise. 【COMPACT & PORTABLE ICE MAKER】This countertop ice maker unit is compact, portable and will work anywhere there is a standard electrical outlet to plug it into. It doesn't need a water line or drain line, making it useful for picnics, camping and outdoor parties. Perfect for boat, small kitchen, restraunts, bars, office, and more. 【SMART INDICATOR WITH VIEW WINDOW】Clear-view lid top made for easy see-through process monitoring and ice level checking. Light indicator displays when the water level in the reservoir runs low so you can add more water. Also this ice maker unit automatically lights related indicator once the ice cubes are finished. 【TWO ICE CUBE SIZE OPTIONS WITH BASKET & ICE SCOOP】You can select small or large ice cube size for different types of beverages. It comes with a basket and ice scoop allowing for easy ice storage and removal. This portable ice cube maker has a 2 liter reservoir for efficiency and reduced waste. Water from melted ice cubes are filtered through its basket and reused. 【ADVANCED CUSTOMER SERVICE】Our Countertop Portable Ice Maker is covered with a 1 year for worry free. It's made from food-grade materials to provide you with healthy and safe ice cubes. Please feel free to contact us if you have any questions about our countertop ice make. Our technical advice and local customer service are provided throughout life. NOTE: Allow one hour for the ice maker to stand upright before first use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Xw2QCnBnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cloud Mountain","source_asin":"B0872XWMS5","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-126133","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0872XWMS5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0872XWMS5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
