window.products.push({"id":126136,"name":"Beaquicy 3363394 ap6008107 Washer Drain Pump Replacement - water pump exact fit Whirlpool Kenmore washing machine lsw9750pw3, 110.26812690, 110.285227","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oDRr9SFuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【1 PACK 3363394 WASHER PUMP】-- 3363394 Kenmore Drain Pump is manufactured for washing machines that do not have belts. It is located in the washing machine drainage system and is used to drain the water from the washing machine.This 3363394 washing machine drain pump has one large and one small port. The large port is 1.6 inches in diameter and the small port is 1.2 inches in diameter. One port connects to the washing tub and the other to the outside of the washing machine for more effective control of the water output. ✅ 【ABS PLASTIC MATERIAL】-- The 3363394 Washing Machine Drain Pump is made of high quality ABS plastic for excellent durability and firmness. ►If washer pump is broken, the washer will have the following conditions, and the pump need to be replaced in time: Washer is leaking, Water is leaking from water pump, Washer fills and drains simultaneously, Clothes are wetter than usual, Washer will not fill, Washer won’t drain, Washer stopped at the rinse cycle. ►Package includes 1 x 3363394 Washer Drain Pump. ✅【365 DAYS WARRANTY】-- The 3363394 Whirlpool Washer Pump support 365 DAYS return and exchange. ►The water pump for direct drive washing machine models manufactured since 1982. The pump mounts directly to the motor with 2 clips. It acts as a drain in the washing machine drainage system, enabling the machine to drain water more quickly. The use of high quality materials gives the product excellent durability and solidity, it will not leak at the joints and and is less likely to break over time. ✅【SUITABLE FOR MANY BRANDS】-- 3363394 Washer Pump replacement for Kenmore, Whirlpool, Crosley, Inglis, Roper and other brands washer. ►Replaces: AP2907492, AP6008107, PS11741239, PS342434, LP116. ►Compatible: 110.82791120, 110.26902690, 110.92380200, 110.26822690, 11026632503, 11022432100, 11020802990, 11026712693, 11027622790, 11082872100, 11024722300, 11026882502, 11020942991, 11026812690, 11027522600, 11028632701, 11026422500, 11025852400, LLR9245BQ1, LSQ9200PQ1, LSB6400LW1, LSQ9600LW0, LSQ9030PQ1, LSR6332KQ0, LSR7233EQ0, LSR7333PQ0, LSB6000PQ0, LSB6400LW1, LSQ9549PW6, LSN1000KQ0, LSQ9110PW4, LSB6000PQ0, LSW9750PW3, LTE5243DQA, ETW4300TQ0, WTW5300VW2, TAWS850PQ2, RAL5144BQ1, etc. ✅【EASY INSTALLATION】-- The installation of 3363394 Washer Drain Pump is simple. Before installation, please disconnect the power and water supply and put on working gloves to protect your hands. Take the washer apart, remove the screws from the clips holding the pump and remove the pump. Disconnect the pipe connected to the pump port, install the new pump according to the previous steps. NOTE: After installation, make sure that the pump is held in place by the clips and does not fall or wobble.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oDRr9SFuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B082SKJK6N","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-126136","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082SKJK6N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B082SKJK6N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
