window.products.push({"id":126209,"name":"Beaquicy Dishwasher Cutlery Filter Basket(9.5 inches x 5.4 inches x 4.8 inches tall) - Replacement for Replacement for Ken-more Whirl-pool Bo-sch Sam-","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TWl5Q2nOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【𝙋𝙍𝙊𝘿𝙐𝘾𝙏 𝙎𝙋𝙀𝘾𝙄𝙁𝙄𝘾𝘼𝙏𝙄𝙊𝙉𝙎】：The dishwasher cutlery filter basket measures 9.5 inches x 5.4 inches x 4.8 inches tall (240mm x 135mm x 240mm). Comprising 7 compartments + 1 handle + 1 small lid (for just one compartment), our dishwasher cutlery filter basket is gray and has openings of varying sizes, allowing organization of kitchen scissors, knives, spoons, forks, silverware, utensils, and other items for easy air drying. 【𝙀𝙍𝙎𝘼𝙏𝙄𝙇𝙄𝙏𝙔 𝙋𝙀𝙍𝙁𝙊𝙍𝙈𝘼𝙉𝘾𝙀】：The dishwasher cutlery filter basket can be divided into 2 or combined into 1, and the handle is also collapsible and removable, making it easier to fit almost all dishwasher models. In addition to putting silverware in the dishwasher, you can also use this basket to air dry dishes after hand washing so you can quickly separate knives and spoons. Dishwasher silver basket is made of high-quality polypropylene plastic that can withstand high temperatures and water pressure. 【𝟯𝟲𝟱 𝘿𝘼𝙔𝙎 𝙒𝘼𝙍𝙍𝘼𝙉𝙏𝙔】：Dishwasher cutlery filter basket supports 365 DAYS return and exchange. Our company attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer. Risk-free shopping, If you have any quality problem during warranty period, please contact customer service in time. We will try our best to solve the problem. Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. 【𝘾𝙊𝙈𝙋𝘼𝙏𝙄𝘽𝙇𝙀 𝘽𝙍𝘼𝙉𝘿】：Universal dishwasher cutlery filter basket suitable for most brands such as Bos-ch, Whirl-pool, Sam-sung, G-E, Ken-more. With it, get to keep your wares safe from bacteria, contaminants, and remnants of food.Be sure to measure your old basket before ordering to ensure proper sizing. 【𝘿𝙄𝙔 𝙞𝙣𝙨𝙩𝙖𝙡𝙡𝙖𝙩𝙞𝙤𝙣】：Wear work gloves to protect hands before installing the dishwasher cutlery filter basket. No tools are required. You can follow the repair videos on Youtube to complete the installation, there are many videos to help you guide the repair, very simple. Our dish baskets are easy to carry and can be easily removed from the dishwasher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TWl5Q2nOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B08FHVJRSY","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-126209","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FHVJRSY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FHVJRSY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
