window.products.push({"id":126318,"name":"Upstreman Portable Mini Washing Machine, Washing and Drying Timer, Three Washing Modes Up to 1700 RPM, Soaking Function,11 lbs Washer and 6.6 lbs Spin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51n13UMmuWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CONVENIENT & PORTABLE： This twin tub washing machine is compact and weighs only 28 lbs, easy to move around, great for apartment, dorm and RV. The space-saving design allows the washing machine to be stored at convenient spot when not in use. 1700 RPM POWERFUL WASH: Provides serious cleaning power, 15-minute high speed wash turns dirty laundry clean like new. Comes with SOFT MODE that offers gentle yet effective wash to delicate laundry. The spin dryer can finish a drying cycle in 5 minutes. 17 LBS TWIN TUB: The 11 lbs washer and 6.7 lbs spin dryer can work simultaneously, cut down the laundry time by half. One load can clean up to 15 shirts, 6 pairs of jeans or 2 jackets. The twin tub design makes your laundry work easier and faster. RELIEVE YOUR HANDS FROM COLD WATER: This washing machine is made to make your life easier. The SOAKING function provide deep, thorough cleaning without you having to touch the cold water. Just set on the TIMER and start, let the washing machine does your laundry so you get to enjoy your life. WHAT YOU GET: A Upstreman twin tub washing machine with a 78.7'' extended American three-pin power cord, a 59'' inlet hose, a 32'' drain hose and a lint filter. We are confident about our products and offer worry-free customer support. NOTE: spin dryer does not completely dry clothes, air dry laundry for full dryness. Air drying laundry can saves electricity and reduces wrinkles.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51n13UMmuWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Upstreman","source_asin":"B09K7MGQXH","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-126318","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09K7MGQXH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09K7MGQXH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
