window.products.push({"id":126401,"name":"41-205 for Frigidaire 316489402 Gas Range Oven Ignitor PS1528536 AP3963555","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.55,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5176kL-PfxL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"SPECS:This igniter's amperage range is 3.3 - 3.6. Used with 3.2 to 3.5 amp rated gas safety valves.  Includes: high temperature stainless steel shield high temperature MGT wire leads and high temperature ceramic wire nuts to wire into harness. Replaces long and short ignitors. Be careful not to drop your new ignitor; ignitors are fragile and will break easily. FOR BRANDS:Frigidaire Electrolux Franklin Gibson White-Westinghouse Westinghouse Tappan Kelvinator Sears Kenmore DESCRIPTION:The oven igniter, also called a glow bar, heats up the bimetal switch and causes the oven to ignite the gas fed to the burners. A common issue when the oven fails to ignite is a faulty glow bar. If the oven does not start within 90 seconds, the glow bar is likely the issue. Do not be fooled if the glow bar turns red. If it does not reach the appropriate temperature, the oven will not light. If your ignitor uses a connector on the end, reuse the connector from the old ignitor. Use your wire cutters to cut the wires on the old ignitor several inches above the connector. Strip the ends of the wires with a wire stripper. Place the end of a wire on the connector next to the end of a wire on your new ignitor. Use a ceramic wire nut to twist and hold the wires together. Your wires are not color coded, so it does not matter which wires are connected together. Your old ignitor can get very hot even if it doesn't ignite the burner tube. REPLACES PART NUMBERS: 316489402 316119301, Also replacement for AP3963555, PS1528536","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5176kL-PfxL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eagleggo","source_asin":"B0777NF84S","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-126401","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0777NF84S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0777NF84S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
