window.products.push({"id":126423,"name":"EveryDrop by Whirlpool Refrigerator Water Filter 6 (Pack of 3)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vq7H+S-yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Now, you and your family can enjoy the enriching benefits of cleaner, freshly filtered ice & water. Not just in beverages, but for preparing meals, too. Even your pets will love it. Everything in life tastes better with EveryDrop Filters by Whirlpool. Our advanced generation of ice & water refrigerator filters from EveryDrop Filters by Whirlpool Water are certified to reduce more contaminants - with new Triple Filtration Technology. Filter 6 reduces 9 types of contaminants, so you can feel reassured that you and your family are getting the most out of your water. Remember to replace your refrigerator filter every 6 months to maximize contaminant reduction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vq7H+S-yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Whirlpool","source_asin":"B00UTC2Y4E","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-126423","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00UTC2Y4E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B00UTC2Y4E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
