window.products.push({"id":126532,"name":"Kenmore 50022 25.4 cu. ft. Side-by-Side Refrigerator in White, includes delivery and hookup","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rmbgAufwL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"This side-by-side fridge has an abundantly spacious 25.4 cubic feet of capacity so you can fit in fresh groceries, snacks and leftovers and still have a bit of extra room. Adjustable shelving and door bins let you keep the fridge organized the way you like, so everything, even leftover lasagna, has a place in your fridge. Adjustable spill-proof glass shelving, gallon door bins and 2 clear crisper drawers give you tons of storage and organization options throughout the fridge. Whether you need to keep the fridge fully stocked for the family or need to keep goodies chilled before the big event, you can customize this fridge to fit your needs. Gallon-sized adjustable door bins, a dairy shelf and tall item accommodation make grabbing commonly-used items quick and easy. Everything has a place in your fridge, even tall wine bottles and wide juice jugs. This Kenmore refrigerator has tight-sealing doors, humidity-controlled crisper drawers and a frost-free freezer so you won’t have to worry about delicate produce going to waste or having to wrestle the ice cream out of the freezer’s frosty grasp. A built-in fresh water dispenser keeps clear, crisp ice and water at the ready, perfect for filling up bottles, pitchers and glasses. The built-in water filter reduces water contaminants, like mercury and lead, so you and your family can enjoy fresh, clean ice and water at the press of a button.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rmbgAufwL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kenmore","source_asin":"B075QVN177","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-126532","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075QVN177","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B075QVN177","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
