window.products.push({"id":126707,"name":"W10619951 Refrigerator Drain Tube Replacement Part by BlueStars - Perfect Fix For Leaky Freezers - Fit Whirlpool Maytag Kenmore - Replaces 2887289 AP5","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.57,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jf14vroAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ NO MORE LEAKING: A clogged drain can be the leading cause of refrigerator leaks. Bluestars Refrigerator Drain Tube will carry the water that has formed during the defrost cycle to where your drain pan is located. If your old drain tube is clogged, the water can back up into your freezer, causing a leaky refrigerator and you may need to replace it with a new one. This product will fix the following symptoms of refrigerators: Leaking | Frost buildup | Freezer not defrosting | Too warm. ✅ PERFECT MATCH: Bluestars Refrigerator Drain Tube is made exactly fit for most top name brands (Whirlpool, Maytag, Kenmore, KitchenAid, Amana, Jenn-Air, Crosley, Inglis, Dacor) and replaces part numbers: 2887289, AP5780744, W10210987, W10210988, W10309238, W10344401, W10344402, W10585186, W10588598, W10604169, W10622098, W10622099, PS8691807. If you are unsure whether this part will fit your model, please send us an inquiry with your model so we can inform you if it fits or not. ✅ PREMIUM QUALITY: Bluestars Refrigerator Drain Tube is made from durable high-quality rubber and fairly thick plastics that are well-tested by the manufacturer, meet OEM standards, ensure long-lasting. As a result, this product will keep your refrigerator cycled again and allow the water to evaporate safely. ✅ EASY TO INSTALL: This is an easy and tool-free installation that helps you avoid costly repairs and replacements. The installation of the pipe itself is very simple, safe, and will not cause any damage to your freezer. The tools you will need for this repair include a 1/4-inch nut driver and a small flat-blade screwdriver. To do this repair you will need to pull the refrigerator forward in order to reach the lower access panel at the back. Don’t forget to unplug your appliance’s power cord. ✅ 𝟏𝟎𝟎% 𝐋𝐈𝐅𝐄𝐓𝐈𝐌𝐄 𝐖𝐀𝐑𝐑𝐀𝐍𝐓𝐘: Customer satisfaction is our priority. If for any reason you're not completely satisfied, we will compensate you and offer extra benefits to ensure your rights. Buy with confidence!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jf14vroAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BlueStars","source_asin":"B07FM5B7T3","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-126707","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FM5B7T3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FM5B7T3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
