window.products.push({"id":126757,"name":"Deflecto Dryer Vent, Wide Mouth Galvanized Vent Hood with Pipe, Silver, 4” (GVH4NR) , GRAY","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HdeY28ROL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Maximize efficiency while protecting your home from birds and rodents with the Deflecto Wide Mouth Galvanized Dryer Vent with Pipe. Safe, all metal venting is commonly used for clothes dryer and bathroom applications. Integrated gravity damper stays shut on its own, and is opened by positive air flow when in use. The wide shroud helps keep the elements out. Durable and weather resistant. Deflecto was founded on innovative, problem solving products. For over a half century, we have built a tradition of discovering and meeting needs with invention and dependable manufacturing. Today, Deflecto is the world’s largest chair mat, bicycle reflector and dryer venting manufacturer and a global leader in sign and literature holders, office workspace accessories and other air distribution products. From the Manufacturer Deflector GVH4 4-Inch Galvanized Vent Hood.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HdeY28ROL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deflecto","source_asin":"B003YCDMJC","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-126757","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003YCDMJC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B003YCDMJC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":126758,"name":"AQUA CREST 469690 ADQ36006101 Refrigerator Water Filter, Replacement for LG® LT700P®, Kenmore® 9690, 46-9690, ADQ36006102, LFXS30766S, HDX FML-3, RFC1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fuPLShRkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What you get in this AQUA CREST refrigerator water filter is an excellent prior filtration performance that stands on par with what you get from the original brand, backed by the standard NSF 42 and 372 certifications. Unlike the generic brands, our refrigerator water filter relies on the 100% superior coconut shell carbon block to get rid of different types of impurities from your water. Excellent filtration beyond your mind: AQUA CREST water filters can reduce such a wide range of harmful substances at a go including suspended particles, chlorine taste and odor from your drinking water. An independent third-party laboratory has verified this claim. 100% fit: The precise production technology adopted by AQUA CREST in this refrigerator water filter means you get a perfect fit, just like the original scale. Besides, AQUA CREST ensures that this DIY process will not take you more than a few minutes. High-quality filter material: AQUA CREST brings you an upgrade with a 100% selected coconut shell carbon block. The surface area is larger. There are also more micropores to increase the filtration process’s efficiency, giving no chance to impurities like bad taste and odor, sediments, chlorine, and heavy metals tested by third lab. Month install stickers: This filter comes with stickers that help you mark the installation date. Now you can worry less about overusing your filter, thanks to this simple yet effective replacement date reminder. You get up to 6 months or 200 gallons of pure-tasting water, depending on the conditions of your water. 100% safe materials: AQUA CREST adopted BPA-free and food-grade materials in making this refrigerator filter. This claim is verified and backed by the NSF 372 certification that declares this filter housing lead-free. Comprehensive product line: We have experts with many years of experience in product development, and they have made AQUA CREST a substantial and high-quality replacement filter solution. With our comprehensive product line of replacement filters and adaptative technology, we take pride in providing clean and fresh water to your hydrated home. Customer support: Our customer service team is always here to get you back. Please feel free to contact us if you have any questions. Replacement for models: LG LT700P, ADQ36006101, ADQ36006101-S, ADQ36006101S, ADQ36006102, ADQ36006102-S, ADQ36006102S, 9690, 46-9690, KENMORE 469690, WATER SENTINEL WSL-3, Water Filter Tree WLF-01 OnePurify RFC1200A ClearWater Filters CWMF041 Blue Signature BLS LT700P Arrowpure APF1400 Purity Pro PF01 Pure Line PL-500 Glacier Water Filters WF-117, Fabfill OP-1200A, Refresh R-9690. LG is a registered trademark of LG CORP.  LG is used for reference purposes only.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fuPLShRkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aqua Crest","source_asin":"B01G50KNJQ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-126758","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01G50KNJQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01G50KNJQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":126759,"name":"Silicone Counter Gap Cover for Kitchen Counters, Stoves, Appliance Gaps - 2-Pack, 25 Inches Each - Heat Resistant, Easy to Clean - Guard Covers Gaps B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61u9kskiM4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HELP KEEP YOUR KITCHEN & COUNTERS CLEAN: These counter gap covers can be placed between counters and an oven / stovetop, or between counters where there is a small gap. With these covers, one can prevent crumbs, food particles, or liquids from falling into hard to reach places. Spills and food remain on the counter, and thus are easier to clean. 2-PACK / GENEROUS SIZE THAT CAN BE EASILY CUT TO FIT SHORTER SURFACES: This product consists of 2 units, enabling one to cover up both sides of a stovetop, or two separate counters. Each unit measures 25\" long by 2\" wide (63.5 * 5cm), and the ridge that fits between counters is 0.4\" (1cm). If necessary, it is easy to cut each unit with scissors or a sharp knife to better enable it to fit the length of one's counter. NEUTRAL COLOR THAT BLENDS IN WITH COUNTERS: The covers are semi-transparent (halfway been clear and a light white), and easily blend in or complement counters or appliances of any color. BPA-FREE PURE SILICONE: Each cover is made of 100% pure silicone, which is food-safe, BPA-free, and able to withstand hot temperatures (from stoves, stovetops, or exhaust of appliances). EASY TO CLEAN: Food debris and spills are easy to remove from these covers. Simply wipe them with a damp cloth, and all residue can be removed quickly. (Additionally, please note that each cover comes rolled up, but is easy to unroll and will stay flat out of the package)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61u9kskiM4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ETTU Kitchen","source_asin":"B07SK13698","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-126759","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SK13698","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SK13698","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
